OL,3,GNEWSAMan drowned in ditch after car
OL,4,Aramming attempt
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man drowned in a ditch full of water
OL,7,Fafter the car he was in tried to ram
OL,8,Fanother vehicle on a country road, a
OL,9,Fcourt was told.
OL,11,FSean Burlton, 28, who was a passenger,
OL,12,Fdied in the incident on Counter Drain
OL,13,FDrove, in Tongue End, Lincolnshire, on
OL,14,F24 November 2023.
OL,16,FDuring the opening of a trial at
OL,17,FLincoln Crown Court, a jury heard
OL,18,FBurlton was in a Ford Focus that had
OL,19,Ftried to ram a VW Touran being driven
OL,20,Fby his girlfriend's ex-partner, Richard
OL,21,FMcMullon.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
