OL,3,GNEWSAMan drowned in ditch after car
OL,4,Aramming attempt
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurlton's partner, Vanessa Gratton, and
OL,7,FScott Biggs both deny conspiring with
OL,8,FBurlton to cause actual bodily harm to
OL,9,FMcMullon between 22 and 25 November
OL,10,F2023.
